1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:00,791
Hello, Bubble!

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,166
Hey, Leafy!

3
00:00:02,291 --> 00:00:05,666
Since you are so wonderful,
I'm giving you a gift!

4
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:10,250
Wow! That's the nicest thing
anyone's ever done for me!

5
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,875
Don't open it, Bubble!
I-It could be a trap!

6
00:00:12,958 --> 00:00:14,958
[sharp inhale] I can do what I want!

7
00:00:15,958 --> 00:00:19,583
Ooh! They're the Springy Shoes I've always wanted!

8
00:00:20,041 --> 00:00:21,000
Thanks, Leafy!

9
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:21,875
You're welcome.

10
00:00:22,083 --> 00:00:23,666
Hey! I want a gift!

11
00:00:23,666 --> 00:00:25,500
- Oh, uhhhm... well- ahh, well...
- Gimme!

12
00:00:26,291 --> 00:00:27,791
- Here!
- Gee, thanks!

13
00:00:28,083 --> 00:00:28,666
Ahhh!

14
00:00:31,625 --> 00:00:33,458
Ice Cube, I got some for you too!

15
00:00:33,458 --> 00:00:34,625
Wha? Thanks!

16
00:00:40,541 --> 00:00:42,166
Hey! Those are mine!

17
00:00:46,375 --> 00:00:53,041
[INTRO PLAYS]

18
00:00:53,041 --> 00:00:54,041
Subtitles: TAFFYMARZI

19
00:00:55,708 --> 00:00:56,916
Let's do Cake at Stake.

20
00:01:09,208 --> 00:01:12,500
So, as the nine of you know,
all of you are up for elimination.

21
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:13,500
Except for me!

22
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,500
Yes, Firey, except for you.

23
00:01:16,166 --> 00:01:18,875
So now it's time to see who will be eliminated.

24
00:01:19,458 --> 00:01:22,708
Announcer:
We've got a large crowd watching us again. Stalkers.

25
00:01:34,791 --> 00:01:36,583
However, one may join the game.

26
00:01:36,583 --> 00:01:37,375
Everyone:
Gasp!

27
00:01:37,458 --> 00:01:38,875
But I'll get to that later.

28
00:01:40,041 --> 00:01:41,791
We have 288 votes.

29
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:46,541
Anyway, here are 8 knives.
If you are safe, I'll throw you a knife.

30
00:01:46,541 --> 00:01:50,125
I'm not sure if I want to be safe!

31
00:01:50,458 --> 00:01:54,041
So first, Firey had immunity so he's safe. Fling.

32
00:01:54,125 --> 00:01:54,666
Wuh!

33
00:01:55,666 --> 00:01:59,541
Also, Ice Cube only had 5 votes.
She is safe. Fling.

34
00:01:59,625 --> 00:02:00,458
Ahhhh!

35
00:02:00,875 --> 00:02:04,166
Announcer:
Bubble and Leafy got 7 and 10 votes respectively.

36
00:02:04,291 --> 00:02:05,458
What a relief!

37
00:02:07,166 --> 00:02:07,541
Hup!

38
00:02:08,541 --> 00:02:13,041
Announcer:
Spongy. Despite your extreme fatness,
you only received 28 votes.

39
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,583
Buh...

40
00:02:14,708 --> 00:02:18,166
On April 1st 2011, history was made.

41
00:02:18,625 --> 00:02:21,875
Englishcreamcakes cast the first vote EVER for Pencil.

42
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,833
Oh no, seriously?!

43
00:02:23,958 --> 00:02:26,833
It turns out she got 37 other votes, too.

44
00:02:27,458 --> 00:02:31,333
Regardless, with only 38 votes, Pencil is safe. Fling.

45
00:02:31,916 --> 00:02:35,125
That's 38 more votes than I expected!

46
00:02:37,250 --> 00:02:41,000
So it's Tennis Ball, Blocky, or Rocky, to be eliminated.

47
00:02:41,583 --> 00:02:43,375
Well, it's not Rocky. Fling.

48
00:02:43,708 --> 00:02:45,000
[SLOW-MO]
Bleh!

49
00:02:48,083 --> 00:02:50,166
And it's not Tennis Ball. Fling.

50
00:02:50,416 --> 00:02:54,916
Ahhhhhhhh!

51
00:02:55,125 --> 00:02:58,833
Blocky, I'm sorry, but you received 112 votes.

52
00:02:59,208 --> 00:03:00,958
That's enough to eliminate you, again.

53
00:03:01,125 --> 00:03:04,791
No! You can't eliminate me!
I-I'm like the star of the show!

54
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:07,333
Blocky:
Ahhhh!

55
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:12,958
So Blocky has been eliminated.

56
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:16,333
Let's take some time to
commemorate Blocky's elimination.

57
00:03:16,333 --> 00:03:18,833
No! Pssh. Let's not do that.

58
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,625
I agree! Let's not.

59
00:03:20,625 --> 00:03:23,500
Fine. Whatever. I guess Blocky gets no love.

60
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,833
Anyway, you are the final 8.

61
00:03:25,833 --> 00:03:29,916
Yay! Being in the final 8 without Coiny is wonderful!

62
00:03:29,916 --> 00:03:32,958
8 is also 2 to the 3rd!

63
00:03:32,958 --> 00:03:35,958
For your information, these are your current scores.

64
00:03:36,416 --> 00:03:41,916
At the end of this episode, the 3 people
with the lowest scores will be up for elimination.

65
00:03:42,125 --> 00:03:46,583
Now it's time to start the 17th contest.
We will be throwing frisbees.

66
00:03:46,708 --> 00:03:47,958
Ooh, yay!

67
00:03:48,250 --> 00:03:48,583
Eh!

68
00:03:49,833 --> 00:03:52,333
But before we can begin, you must pair up.

69
00:03:52,333 --> 00:03:55,916
Uhh, pair up? Okay.

70
00:03:56,208 --> 00:04:00,083
OMG, Bubble, we so, like, have to be partners!

71
00:04:00,083 --> 00:04:00,875
Yeah!

72
00:04:01,708 --> 00:04:02,333
Wha?

73
00:04:02,333 --> 00:04:07,250
Oh, sorry, Ice Cube. I'd let you in if I could, but I can't.

74
00:04:07,666 --> 00:04:08,250
Gagh!

75
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:09,750
Revenge!

76
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:12,250
Hmmm... Ah hah!

77
00:04:12,250 --> 00:04:15,041
Leafy:
Ice Cube, come on down, you can be my ally!

78
00:04:15,041 --> 00:04:19,041
Thanks for picking me! Pencil
wouldn't let me into her alliance.

79
00:04:19,041 --> 00:04:22,458
You are in our alliance Icy, just not right now.

80
00:04:24,125 --> 00:04:24,708
Bleh!

81
00:04:25,458 --> 00:04:29,291
Well, the gross ones are in a team,
so I-I guess I'm with you, Tennis Ball.

82
00:04:29,875 --> 00:04:31,583
So are you done forming teams?

83
00:04:31,583 --> 00:04:32,750
Everyone:
Yeah!

84
00:04:32,958 --> 00:04:34,375
Each team gets a Frisbee.

85
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:39,875
Stay on opposite sides of the zone.
Try to have three successful catches.

86
00:04:39,875 --> 00:04:42,875
Ooh! That might not be so easy!

87
00:04:42,875 --> 00:04:45,458
But if you don't finish before the Sun goes down...

88
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:46,291
You.

89
00:04:46,291 --> 00:04:46,916
Will.

90
00:04:46,916 --> 00:04:47,666
Incur.

91
00:04:47,666 --> 00:04:48,416
A PENALTY.

92
00:04:50,250 --> 00:04:50,708
Go.

93
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:52,625
Okay, ready?

94
00:04:52,833 --> 00:04:53,291
Ready!

95
00:04:54,583 --> 00:04:56,458
- Ugh...
- Sorry!

96
00:04:56,791 --> 00:04:58,875
Come on, Ice Cube! Let's get first!

97
00:05:00,291 --> 00:05:00,875
Leafy:
Gasp!

98
00:05:02,875 --> 00:05:03,291
Bleh!

99
00:05:04,833 --> 00:05:05,782
Throw harder!

100
00:05:05,875 --> 00:05:06,208
Yuh!

101
00:05:06,333 --> 00:05:06,666
Hurgh!

102
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,541
Wow! That was amazing!

103
00:05:09,708 --> 00:05:10,458
Hueh!

104
00:05:10,458 --> 00:05:11,375
I know, right?

105
00:05:12,166 --> 00:05:15,708
Oh no! Your saliva is too sticky!

106
00:05:15,958 --> 00:05:18,458
Do I want to recover a
recently destroyed Ice Cube? Yes.

107
00:05:18,708 --> 00:05:21,166
When was the ice cube destroyed?
Around 22 seconds ago.

108
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:24,416
What were the dimensions of the Ice Cube?
8 by 9 by 11.

109
00:05:24,666 --> 00:05:25,083
Buh!

110
00:05:25,291 --> 00:05:25,625
Hmph!

111
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:28,333
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry! The other teams are catching up!

112
00:05:28,333 --> 00:05:29,750
I'm trying!

113
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,875
Alliance power!

114
00:05:33,416 --> 00:05:35,500
Yeah, Bubble! Air five!

115
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,916
Firey:
Tennis Ball! Hurry! Now!

116
00:05:41,208 --> 00:05:43,458
Hmm.... tap water, I believe?

117
00:05:44,583 --> 00:05:45,891
Yeah! We're done!

118
00:05:46,166 --> 00:05:47,791
- Bleh!
- Ommm!

119
00:05:47,791 --> 00:05:49,625
Yaaay! We finished!

120
00:05:50,125 --> 00:05:51,541
Two teams have finished.

121
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,875
Two have not.

122
00:05:53,333 --> 00:05:55,416
And what do you know?
The sun is setting.

123
00:05:55,833 --> 00:05:56,750
Ennngh!

124
00:05:56,875 --> 00:05:58,583
Here! I'll get another frisbee!

125
00:05:58,583 --> 00:05:59,666
Haannhahhaannngh...

126
00:05:59,708 --> 00:06:00,083
Hueh!

127
00:06:00,083 --> 00:06:01,125
Hnnnngh!

128
00:06:01,250 --> 00:06:02,000
Hurry!

129
00:06:02,166 --> 00:06:02,416
Hueh!

130
00:06:02,875 --> 00:06:04,375
Phew! That's three!

131
00:06:05,416 --> 00:06:07,791
Wow, that was too close.

132
00:06:08,458 --> 00:06:11,666
Okay, final question. What was the Ice Cube's personality?

133
00:06:12,166 --> 00:06:15,625
Hmm... I'd say quiet and vengeful.

134
00:06:16,291 --> 00:06:19,625
Yay! Ice Cube! Now get to the other side...

135
00:06:20,791 --> 00:06:22,041
...and catch this frisbee!

136
00:06:23,458 --> 00:06:25,041
Noooo!

137
00:06:25,291 --> 00:06:28,708
That's the end. Ice Cube and Leafy will receive a penalty.

138
00:06:30,833 --> 00:06:32,500
Well, that was a short night.

139
00:06:32,916 --> 00:06:35,083
Now it's time to receive your rewards.

140
00:06:35,625 --> 00:06:41,541
First, Ice Cube, for receiving the
fewest votes at this Cake at Stake, you get a prize.

141
00:06:41,541 --> 00:06:44,750
[beautiful harp music plays]

142
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:45,375
[applause]

143
00:06:45,375 --> 00:06:47,500
[applause]
Congratulations, Ice Cube!

144
00:06:50,875 --> 00:06:53,666
Announcer:
Pencil and Bubble were the first to finish their catches.

145
00:06:53,958 --> 00:06:55,750
Ooh, let's see what we get!

146
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:58,583
[beautiful harp music plays]

147
00:06:58,583 --> 00:06:58,875
[applause]

148
00:06:58,875 --> 00:07:00,250
[applause]
OMG, yay!

149
00:07:00,250 --> 00:07:01,500
[applause dies down]

150
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:02,833
What'd we get?

151
00:07:02,833 --> 00:07:05,541
[beautiful harp music plays]

152
00:07:05,541 --> 00:07:05,916
[applause]

153
00:07:05,916 --> 00:07:06,458
[applause]
Meh.

154
00:07:06,458 --> 00:07:07,208
[applause continues]

155
00:07:07,208 --> 00:07:09,708
Okay, Tennis Ball, here it is.

156
00:07:09,708 --> 00:07:12,250
[beautiful harp music plays]

157
00:07:12,250 --> 00:07:12,875
[faint applause]

158
00:07:12,875 --> 00:07:15,708
It's not much, but I guess I'll take it.

159
00:07:16,083 --> 00:07:17,166
Let's add those up.

160
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,949
Announcer:
Ice Cube and Leafy, you received a penalty.

161
00:07:27,041 --> 00:07:28,708
Ohh, let's see what it is.

162
00:07:28,833 --> 00:07:31,458
[beautiful harp music plays]

163
00:07:31,458 --> 00:07:37,500
[huge applause]

164
00:07:37,916 --> 00:07:40,125
Hey guys! For a prank,

165
00:07:40,125 --> 00:07:42,875
Blocky:
suspend the Firey Recovery Center above a lake.

166
00:07:43,083 --> 00:07:44,000
Blocky:
It's simple!

167
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:48,791
Blocky:
Idea by Simondomino and Geriolah7!

168
00:07:50,375 --> 00:07:56,875
Voiceover:
This program was brought to you by
Blocky's Funny Doings International.

169
00:07:59,833 --> 00:08:03,250
Leafy and Ice Cube, you each lost 1,000 points.

170
00:08:05,083 --> 00:08:07,083
Announcer:
So these are your current scores.

171
00:08:08,916 --> 00:08:12,333
Announcer:
Tennis Ball, Ice Cube, and Leafy are in the danger zone.

172
00:08:12,833 --> 00:08:17,083
But the voters won't be deciding who will be eliminated.
The contestants will.

173
00:08:17,208 --> 00:08:18,041
Everyone:
Gasp!

174
00:08:18,125 --> 00:08:23,041
Announcer:
The five contestants who aren't in the danger zone
will have one month to choose who to eliminate.

175
00:08:23,083 --> 00:08:26,083
Ooh, ha hah! Finally some control!

176
00:08:26,291 --> 00:08:27,916
But what will the voters vote on?

177
00:08:28,625 --> 00:08:32,291
Well, it turns out that one
recommended character will join the game.

178
00:08:32,375 --> 00:08:33,208
Everyone:
Gasp!

179
00:08:33,541 --> 00:08:35,333
We need help deciding which one.

180
00:08:36,041 --> 00:08:38,583
Thirty characters were hand-picked out of hundreds.

181
00:08:39,125 --> 00:08:39,833
Here they are.

182
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,208
I don't have a favorite number. I really don't.

183
00:08:44,208 --> 00:08:45,958
Ba-ah-hoh! Ah-ah-hohleh!

184
00:08:46,166 --> 00:08:46,375
[bag rips]

185
00:08:46,708 --> 00:08:48,000
[barf leaks out of bag]

186
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,208
Tennis balls aren't the only ones with lines!

187
00:08:50,375 --> 00:08:51,791
[ding]

188
00:08:52,125 --> 00:08:53,750
OH NO, FIREY, YOU LIT MY FUSE!

189
00:08:54,041 --> 00:08:56,000
I'm a dictionary and you better believe it!

190
00:08:56,125 --> 00:08:57,375
Watches are wannabes.

191
00:08:58,791 --> 00:08:59,958
[thunder and lightning strikes]

192
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:02,041
[demonic-like voice]
AW, SERIOUSLY?!

193
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:03,958
[speaking unintelligibly fast]

194
00:09:05,291 --> 00:09:05,708
[cracks]

195
00:09:06,833 --> 00:09:07,958
[BM!]

196
00:09:08,250 --> 00:09:09,000
I hate you!

197
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,958
[eating fries]

198
00:09:12,333 --> 00:09:13,252
[rustles]

199
00:09:14,041 --> 00:09:15,333
I have a tattoo.

200
00:09:16,875 --> 00:09:17,208
[nails on Woody]

201
00:09:17,208 --> 00:09:18,000
Woody:
Ahhhhh!

202
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,208
[deep voice]
I am the new Coiny!

203
00:09:23,125 --> 00:09:24,125
[explodes]

204
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:25,500
[breathes]

205
00:09:28,125 --> 00:09:29,958
Vote for me or I'll crush you!

206
00:09:30,375 --> 00:09:31,875
-... ..-. -.. ..

207
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,000
Please, please, please!
Can I join the game?! Please, please-

208
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,916
[saws on Woody]
Woody: Ahhhh!

209
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,875
[leaves rustle]

210
00:09:39,875 --> 00:09:40,750
♪ Dah-dah-dah-dah-dah-dah ♪

211
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:41,958
♪ Cake at Stake! ♪

212
00:09:41,958 --> 00:09:47,708
Voters, comment to vote who you think should
join the battle. Voting ends May 10th.

213
00:09:56,291 --> 00:09:58,541
Everyone in TLC:
Ahhhh!